  "question": {
    "text": "A ball is thrown horizontally from a height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math> above a staircase as shown in the figure. If the coefficient of restitution for any collision between the ball and the staircase is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;for which the ball will bounce the same height above each step, is<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/nhorvfpsnhbxtprwjsegmrvounvhnwzutzylgpmqhvrgpnakhy.jpg\" />",
    "image": null
  },
